WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.221
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with communities

00:00:05.221 --> 00:00:05.939
across Africa.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:09.407
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:13.663
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:19.928
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse. Explain one respectful

00:00:19.928 --> 00:00:22.698
similarity or difference with another African example.
